    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēlĭfĭcātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		velifico, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a making sail</i>, <i>sailing.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mutatā velificatione,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 1, 9, 21</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">velificatione plenā in rempublicam
					ferebatur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 18, 5, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">velificatione tranquillā, ut aiunt,
					ferebatur ad gloriam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 29, 2, 22</span></i>
			.</div>
